  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Forlorne’s “Breath Weapon” turns people into weredrakes.</p><p>While under the <em>Weredrake Curse</em>, the target drops their equipment and loot and transforms into a @UUID[Compendium.dh-weredragon.weredragon-adversaries.Actor.dhwdWeredrake000]{Weredrake} adversary under the GM’s control. After this condition is cleared, the target retains no memory of their time as a weredrake.</p><p>A Cursed condition can be cleared only by magic from a spell, ritual, magic item, location, supernatural occurrence, higher power, or some combination of these options. Lady Lavender’s Longsword and the Zoetrope of the Bright Bacchanal both end curses.</p>",
